{"title":"Silver Hide","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Moonhart, Glimmerfox</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"moonhart\" title=\"Moonhart - dropped it in 464 of 557 looted corpses (1/1.2)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3bc9f909e37f5929cdb.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Moonhart</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.2<br>×1–13</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"glimmerfox\" title=\"Glimmerfox - dropped it in 17 of 22 looted corpses (1/1.3)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7418be6744e1d02a8b58.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.3<br>×1–3</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"silver-hide\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/33e265dd0c1eb3e33136.svg\" alt=\"Silver Hide\"></div><h3>Silver Hide</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>2 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/20/2026, 10:29:14 AM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}